          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "10.03.01-S006",
          "text": "首件检查了吗？",
          "meaning_my": "ပထမဆုံးလုပ်တဲ့ပစ္စည်းကို စစ်ပြီးပြီလား။",
          "replies": [],
