          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "10.03.01-S017",
          "text": "不合格的单独放。",
          "meaning_my": "အရည်အသွေးမမီတာတွေကို သီးသန့်ထားပါ။",
          "replies": [],
