          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "10.03.02-S003",
          "text": "这批货有质量问题。",
          "meaning_my": "ဒီကုန်ပစ္စည်းအသုတ်မှာ အရည်အသွေးပြဿနာ ရှိတယ်။",
          "replies": [],
          "alternatives": [],
