          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review"
        },
        {
          "id": "10.03.03-S009",
          "text": "机器疑似漏电，别碰！",
          "meaning_my": "စက်က လျှပ်စစ်ယိုနေသလိုပဲ၊ မထိနဲ့။",
